sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as ROS 2 Client
    participant N as adi_iio node
    participant T as IIOEvent topic
    participant H as libiio ctx / IIO HW
    Note over C,N: precondition: event armed via EventAttrWriteString (threshold/value, then *_en=1)
    C->>N: EventEnableTopic(device_path, topic_name)
    N->>H: create event stream for device
    N->>T: create publisher, start read thread
    N-->>C: success
    loop on every HW event (push-driven, no polling rate)
        H-->>N: iio_event (blocking read)
        N->>N: decode type / direction / channel
        N->>T: publish IIOEvent
        T-->>C: IIOEvent
    end
    C->>N: EventDisableTopic(device_path)
    N->>H: destroy event stream (unblocks read thread)
    N->>T: join thread, destroy publisher
    N-->>C: success
